    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335040/extras/e6fd235191031e6adbc700626aa27f04.avif?t=1752765404\" width=800 height=222 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335040/extras/095b824d03f8b2bebb6bf201b916c10f.avif?t=1752765404\" width=800 height=222 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335040/extras/1b090d092cec89601f5061aef0d6f2e8.avif?t=1752765404\" width=800 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a cataclysmic event, Valoria has fallen into despair. Mysterious powers have taken over and now controls the kingdom, spreading its influence to every corner and bending it to its will. When the raid that killed your family and destroyed your home left you with nothing, it ignited a burning desire for revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335040/extras/da530fb4d46944b0f5a464fb9094f74f.avif?t=1752765404\" width=800 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The path to victory is paved in blood. Slash, dash and kill your way through countless enemies and\u00a0powerful bosses with fast paced combat, special abilities, and fluid movement mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335040/extras/340e3685878f75ff593ca7d38ad4b892.avif?t=1752765404\" width=800 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on main quests and side quests which shape the world around you. Meet a cast of characters each with their own stories and motives, and leave your mark on Valoria as you uncover the truth behind its collapse. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335040/extras/a05ffa1628b33e195b51412758d7a153.avif?t=1752765404\" width=800 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once, you had a family. Once, this kingdom thrived. Now, all that remains is a dying land and a heart full of retribution. Rise from the ashes. Valoria\u2019s fate rests in your hands.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335040/extras/1b090d092cec89601f5061aef0d6f2e8.avif?t=1752765404\" width=800 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a cataclysmic event, Valoria has fallen into despair. Mysterious powers have taken over and now controls the kingdom, spreading its influence to every corner and bending it to its will. When the raid that killed your family and destroyed your home left you with nothing, it ignited a burning desire for revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335040/extras/da530fb4d46944b0f5a464fb9094f74f.avif?t=1752765404\" width=800 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The path to victory is paved in blood. Slash, dash and kill your way through countless enemies and\u00a0powerful bosses with fast paced combat, special abilities, and fluid movement mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335040/extras/340e3685878f75ff593ca7d38ad4b892.avif?t=1752765404\" width=800 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on main quests and side quests which shape the world around you. Meet a cast of characters each with their own stories and motives, and leave your mark on Valoria as you uncover the truth behind its collapse. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335040/extras/a05ffa1628b33e195b51412758d7a153.avif?t=1752765404\" width=800 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once, you had a family. Once, this kingdom thrived. Now, all that remains is a dying land and a heart full of retribution. Rise from the ashes. Valoria\u2019s fate rests in your hands.</p>",
    "short_description": "Play as a daring heroine, fight hordes of enemies and challenging bosses, solve puzzles, uncover new areas, and experience a gripping story. Embark on a quest to banish evil and restore Valoria to its former glory in this 2.5D side-scrolling adventure.",
